  "title": "Pasta With Spinach Sauce",
  "description": "Chopped spinach and garlic are added to sauteed onions and ham, then stirred into a tart and creamy blend of sour cream, cream of celery soup and Parmesan cheese to make a deliciously easy sauce over spaghetti or egg noodles.",
